        {
          "id": 1710569370,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I think we probably need to let this fall through further so that `value_ret` gets set correctly when it's provided.\n\nIf we set `p` to some flag value and skip the `global_services_lookup` call based on that, I think the rest of the function will do the right thing as `name` and `serv_port_names` will be `NULL`.",
